{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrown into and locked in an abandoned mental asylum, you are forced to partake in an experiment testing your thinking and survival skills. Whether you escape depends solely on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The person who designed this insane experiment won't make it easy on you. Escaping will require you to stay invisible and quiet as a mouse, as he will be searching for you. Can you survive without going insane?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: <strong>Find a way out.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay hidden.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mystery of what's happening within those walls.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027820?t=1759091369","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027820?t=1759091369","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/793551875a9f404f70a7efebb2b037f596fbe987/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759091369","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027820/793551875a9f404f70a7efebb2b037f596fbe987/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759091369","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"You are locked in an abandoned insane asylum and are hunted by an aggressive doctor."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrown into and locked in an abandoned mental asylum, you are forced to partake in an experiment testing your thinking and survival skills. Whether you escape depends solely on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The person who designed this insane experiment won't make it easy on you. Escaping will require you to stay invisible and quiet as a mouse, as he will be searching for you. Can you s